+--!strict
+-- The Cliffwind skyhood (zone armour, the CliffwindHelm base): the ridge
+-- valkyrie's headpiece. A pale sky-blue hood drawn over the crown and nape,
+-- open at the face and trimmed in cloud white, with a cloud-white crest that
+-- curves up and back like a feather caught by the ridge wind. A thin steel
+-- circlet crosses the brow and a short white veil hangs at the nape, kept
+-- narrow at the ears so the outline stays a hood and never a helmet.
+local ArmourLookTypes = require("../../ArmourLookTypes")
+local Kit = require("./Kit")
+
+local sky = { 128, 152, 176 }
+local skyDeep = { 92, 116, 142 }
+local cloud = { 172, 176, 180 }
+local steel = { 132, 138, 146 }
+local steelDark = { 94, 100, 108 }
